      "writtenOn": "2024-03-04T18:39:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question. We have no recovery mechanism for getting a null pointer out of this method. Currently, we either handle it at each call site (like in `topshim/src/profiles/gatt.rs` where we return an Option (which we never actually check against)) or just let it fail wherever it is first used. Consolidating the panic into an explicit and informative failure seems like a better choice.",
      "parentUuid": "3e72acb1_033726c5",
      "revId": "9544c285b28cedf0c3e177b0822fd16e07315945",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
